# Commands
when running python commands in the terminal, use `uv run python`. Note that `uv` should run from the `/backend` directory (from root of the shuscribe project), so you should cd into the `/backend` directory first.

## Pytest Usage
- Default: `uv run pytest` (quiet, warnings+ only)
- Debug: `uv run pytest --log-level=DEBUG` (verbose logging)
- Specific tests: `uv run pytest tests/test_database/`